OL,3,GNEWSARapper ordered to pay back
OL,4,A#200,000 of drugs money
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Digga D has been ordered to pay
OL,7,Fback more than #200,000 he earned from
OL,8,Fdealing drugs or face two years in
OL,9,Fprison.
OL,11,FThe drill star, whose real name is Rhys
OL,12,FHerbert, was jailed for three years and
OL,13,F11 months in January 2025 after
OL,14,Fadmitting importing and selling 99lbs
OL,15,F(45kg) of cannabis.
OL,17,FHe was arrested while doing a
OL,18,Flivestream at a property near Lincoln
OL,19,Fin February 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
