OL,3,GNEWSARapper ordered to pay back
OL,4,A#200,000 of drugs money
OL,5,
OL,6,FHerbert, 25, who has since been
OL,7,Freleased from prison, was made the
OL,8,Fsubject of a Proceeds of Crime Act
OL,9,Forder at Lincoln Crown Court on
OL,10,FWednesday, which was told he had
OL,11,Fbenefited to the tune of #201,039 from
OL,12,Fhis crimes.
